    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i feel like i've lost way more than just a little bit of salt, like i'm totally drained. 2000mg doesn't seem that crazy if i'm replacing what i sweated out. wouldn't a stronger dose actually help me recover faster so i'm not feeling like this all night? i'm really struggling here.",
