    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what u mean about the balance but i really dont have any sports drinks on hand right now and honestly i dont want to wait around for a delivery or go to the store while i feel this bad. if i just split the dose up over the next hour instead of all at once, would that be okay? i just want to know if i can rely on the supplements i have right now to stop these cramps.",
